{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的感受词条过密，尤其是非定时感受连续堆叠时，扫读负担明显高于X，容易让观众忙于读字而顾不上听音乐。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段心理变化的关键落点，又用定时出现的感受把音乐变化与人物感受对应起来，观众更容易抓住每段究竟发生了什么、为什么发生。它对舍不得、受委屈、怀念亲近、害怕孤单和最终坚持离开的层次处理更细，反复出现的「自己人」「暖意」「独自扛事」也让前后形成更清楚的联系。X的优势是文字更容易扫读、叙述更紧凑，但感受表达相对概括，音乐与心理之间的细腻对应有所损失。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e2ffa94f-9662-444b-8c45-1bbbffe07d3c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T090803276005Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.078, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T09:08:36.361184+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7e601f3263ecb885ddb4526c82c6a454ed0b565ef3a1da568f2a524686d80ae7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt